%% A sample Mermaid diagram for verifying the .mmd preview.
%% Open this file in the DSH right-sidebar document viewer.
flowchart TD
    A[Open .mmd in the sidebar] --> B{Preview implementation registered?}
    B -- yes --> C[Mermaid renders the diagram]
    B -- no --> D[Plain highlighted source]
    C --> E{Theme is dark?}
    E -- yes --> F[Dark palette]
    E -- no --> G[Light palette]
    F --> H[Done]
    G --> H
